	<body lang=EN-US link=blue vlink=purple style='tab-interval:.5in'>
	<div class="WordSection1">
	<table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellpadding="0" width="720" style="width: 7.5in; mso-cellspacing: 1.5pt; background: white; border: solid #E5E5E5 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid #E5E5E5 .75pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 10.5pt 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;">
	<tbody>
	<tr style="height: 38px;">
	<td style="border: none; padding: 9pt 0.75pt 3.75pt 35.25pt; height: 38px;">
	<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color: #4e89cc;"><span style="font-size: 24pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;">Application Status</span><span style="font-size: 24pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;"> </span></span></p>
	</td>
	</tr>
	<tr style="height: 16px;">
	<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 30pt 0.75pt 27.75pt; height: 16px;">
	<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align: center; line-height: 15.0pt;"><hr size="1" width="100%" noshade="noshade" style="color: #e5e5e5;" align="center" /></div>
	</td>
	</tr>
	<tr style="height: 248px;">
	<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 248px;">
	<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: #666666;">Thank you for applying to access the Intel® Software Development Platform (SDP) Support Center.<o:p></o:p></span></p></br>
	<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 15.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;"><span style="color: #666666;"><span style="font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·</span></span><span style="font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;">Upon approval, you will be able to submit support requests <span style="color: #4e89cc;"><u><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/design/ipla/software-development-platforms/support.html" style="color: #4e89cc;">here</a></u></span>. <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>
	<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 15.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;"><span style="color: #666666;"><span style="font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';"></span></span></span><span style="font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;">You will also be able to download Intel® SDP collateral and software <span style="color: #4e89cc;"><u><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/design/ipla/software-development-platforms/sdp-design-center.html" style="color: #4e89cc;">here</a></u></span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p></br>
	<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: #666666;">You should expect a response within 1 business day.<o:p> </o:p></span></p></br>
	<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="color: #666666;"><span style="font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;">If you have any questions, please contact us at <span style="color: #4e89cc;"><span class="MsoHyperlink"><a href="mailto:SDPSupport@intel.com">SDPSupport@intel.com</a></span></span></span>.<span style="font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>
	<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma',sans-serif; color: #666666;"><br /> Please retain this e-mail for future reference and visit this <span style="color: #4e89cc;"><u><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/my-intel/profile.html" style="color: #4e89cc;">link</a></u></span> at any time to manage your profile.</span></p>
	</td>
	</tr>
	<tr style="height: 103px;" id="disclaimer">
	<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 103px;">
	<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: #666666;">Please DO NOT reply to this e-mail as it is sent from an automated system and replies are not monitored.<br /> </br>To ensure that you continue receiving our e-mails, please add us to your address book. <o:p></o:p></span></p>
	<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: #666666;"><o:p> </o:p></span></p></br>
	<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: #666666;">Sincerely,<o:p></o:p></span></p></br>
	<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: #666666;">The Intel® SDP Support Team</span></p>
	</td>
	</tr>
	<tr style="height: 16px;">
	<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 30pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 16px;">
	<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align: center; line-height: 15.0pt;"><hr size="1" width="100%" noshade="noshade" style="color: #e5e5e5;" align="center" /></div>
	</td>
	</tr>
	<tr style="height: 41px;">
	<td style="border: none; padding: 9pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 41px;">
	<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma',sans-serif; color: #666666;">Intel is committed to protecting your privacy. For more information, <br /> please see </span><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma',sans-serif; color: #595959; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-themetint: 166; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #595959; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%; mso-style-textfill-fill-colortransforms: 'lumm=65000 lumo=35000';">the <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/privacy/intel-online-privacy-notice-summary.html"><span style="color: #4e89cc; background: yellow; text-decoration: none;">Intel Privacy Notice</span><span style="color: #595959; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-themetint: 166; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #595959; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%; mso-style-textfill-fill-colortransforms: 'lumm=65000 lumo=35000'; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;">.</span></a></span><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma',sans-serif; color: #666666;"> </span></p>
	</td>
	</tr>
	<tr style="height: 62px;">
	<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 10.5pt 33pt; height: 62px;">
	<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma',sans-serif; color: #666666;"><span style="color: #4e89cc;"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/legal/terms-of-use.html?iid=ftr%20terms" style="color: #4e89cc;"><span style="text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;">Legal Information</span></a> | <a href="https://www.intel.com/sites/corporate/tradmarx.htm" style="color: #4e89cc;"><span style="text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;">Trademarks</span></a></span> © Intel Corporation. All rights reserved.<br /> *Other names and brands may be claimed as the property of others.<br /> **Intel is not responsible for content of sites outside our intranet sites. </span></p>
	</td>
	</tr>
	<tr style="height: 14.3333px;">
	<td style="border: none; text-align:right;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"> <img class="floating" src="
	https://www.intel.com/content/dam/logos/intel-logo.png"
	   height="42" width="64" /></span>
	</tr>
	</tbody>
	</table>
	<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
	</div>
